 "description": "Full Packagist registry record for one PHP/Composer package named in vendor/package form, e.g. symfony/console. Returns description, repository URL, maintainers, license, type, download and favers counts, and every published version with its requires, autoload, and dist details. Answers what a Composer package is, who maintains it, and what each release declares.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
